#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0378 expect=violation domain=TT
#note "TTENRL is not present in the dataset, so the wave E Requirements.Variables.All [TTENRL, TTDUR] leg is unmet and the parent SKIPS - before the Any -> All rewrite this file expected a violation at row 2. The finding is NOT lost: this dataset is byte-for-byte the R-5.25 split sibling CDISC-SEND-0378-B's -violation_ttdur_blank scenario, which reports row 2 at its location. Four disjoint states: both present -> parent; one absent -> that column's sibling; neither -> the dataset sister."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-2
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TT class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col RSTGCD  type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col RSTAGE  type=Char label="Description of Repro Stage"
col TTDUR   type=Char label="Planned Duration of Repro Stage"
---
S1 | TT | ST1 | Premating | P14D
S1 | TT | ST2 | Gestation |
